38:12.540 --> 38:13.374
One.

38:14.500 --> 38:15.626
One.

38:16.210 --> 38:18.254
Five. Four.

38:18.796 --> 38:19.714
Five.

38:20.423 --> 38:21.257
Five.

38:22.091 --> 38:22.967
Three.

